# Sanitized templates. Defaults target the isolated local harness; production API and Access endpoints are live.
# Variables use HTTP-client interpolation; access/refresh/code/verifier are obtained at runtime.
@api = http://127.0.0.1:3300
@access = http://127.0.0.1:3303
@token = REPLACE_AT_RUNTIME
@key = 10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@generation = 10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@upload = 20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@selection = 30000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@scene = 40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@view = 40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002
@item = MS-0123456789

### 1. Discovery. Launch authorization in the system browser using a fresh saved state/verifier.
GET {{access}}/.well-known/oauth-authorization-server

### 2. PKCE exchange, no secret/cookie. The harness redirect is test-only.
POST {{access}}/oauth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=authorization_code&client_id=zenora-android&redirect_uri=dev.zenora.android%3A%2Foauth%2Fcallback&code=REPLACE_AT_RUNTIME&code_verifier=REPLACE_WITH_SAVED_VERIFIER

### 3. Identify account before replaying pending local mutations.
GET {{api}}/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Discover effective operations/limits.
GET {{api}}/v1/capabilities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Persist body/key/account BEFORE send. Omitted seed is random; here null preserves that choice.
POST {{api}}/v1/generations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"prompt":"A quiet coastal house in afternoon light.","seed":null,"width":1024,"height":1536,"preset":"quality","previews":true}

### 6. Lost response: resend EXACTLY request5, same key/body, never a new key.
### App terminated: restore the returned generation ID and account, then fetch it and active work.
GET {{api}}/v1/generations/{{generation}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Foreground recovery.
GET {{api}}/v1/generations/active
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Actual progress and cursor replay. Close stream on background; job continues.
GET {{api}}/v1/generations/{{generation}}/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Last-Event-ID: 2-0
Accept: text/event-stream

### 9. Download only newest pending preview from its event URL.
GET {{api}}/v1/generations/{{generation}}/previews/a1-s4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Completed original bytes.
GET {{api}}/v1/generations/{{generation}}/result?download=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Effective settings.
GET {{api}}/v1/generations/{{generation}}/manifest
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. Cooperative cancellation, never automatically replaces a request.
POST {{api}}/v1/generations/{{generation}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. Upload original bytes. Persist upload ID; retry same ID/bytes.
PUT {{api}}/v1/uploads/{{upload}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: image/png
X-Filename: reference.png

< ./fixtures/synthetic.png

### 14. Analysis returns explicit person choices. Use a real returned person_id, not the sample placeholder.
GET {{api}}/v1/uploads/{{upload}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 15. Explicit role selection; changing it requires a new selection ID.
PUT {{api}}/v1/uploads/selections/{{selection}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"asset_id":"{{upload}}","role":"face","person_id":"SELECT_RETURNED_PERSON","box":{"x":0.2,"y":0.1,"width":0.3,"height":0.3},"points":[]}

### 16. Wait for selection.job.status=succeeded, then use the complete recipe.
POST {{api}}/v1/generations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: 10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002
Content-Type: application/json

{"prompt":"@Person1 in a sunlit studio.","seed":42,"width":1024,"height":1536,"preset":"quality","previews":true,"reference_recipe":{"version":"moss-references-v1","operation":"create","subjects":[{"id":"50000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001","alias":"Person1","source_asset_id":"{{upload}}","placement":{"x":0.1,"y":0.05,"width":0.8,"height":0.9},"face":"{{selection}}","pose":null,"clothes":null}]}}

### 17. Prepare depth. No worker ID, pipeline path or model parameter supplied by the app.
POST {{api}}/v1/camera/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{scene}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"kind":"depth","source_id":"{{generation}}"}

### 18. Read depth dimensions; /result is little-endian float32, not a PNG.
GET {{api}}/v1/camera/tasks/{{scene}}/manifest
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 19. After scene completion render a new view.
POST {{api}}/v1/camera/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{view}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"kind":"camera_view","source_id":"{{generation}}","scene_id":"{{scene}}","camera":{"yaw":5,"pitch":0,"zoom":1},"seed":42}

### 20. Save separate library variation after success.
POST {{api}}/v1/camera/tasks/{{view}}/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 21. Library with page-based pagination.
GET {{api}}/v1/library/items?page=1&grouped=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 22. Review every asset and license BEFORE consent.
POST {{api}}/v1/community/contributions/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"source_id":"{{item}}"}

### 23. Explicit consent with exact preview hash and all reviewed asset IDs.
POST {{api}}/v1/community/contributions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: 60000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json

{"source_id":"{{item}}","title":"Afternoon light","caption":"","preview_hash":"REPLACE_WITH_RETURNED_HASH","asset_consents":["result"],"rights_confirmed":true,"license":"CC-BY-4.0"}

### 24. Poll contribution ID returned by23. Checking does not mean public.
GET {{api}}/v1/community/contributions/60000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 25. Public browse does not require a token.
GET {{api}}/v1/community/images?page=1&view=selected

### 26. Serialize refresh, save replacement atomically; never retry an uncertain refresh response.
POST {{access}}/oauth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=refresh_token&client_id=zenora-android&refresh_token=REPLACE_AT_RUNTIME

### 27. Expired token ->401; community-only token ->403 Studio; temporary identity outage ->503, not logout.
GET {{api}}/v1/generations/active
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 28. List and revoke own device sessions for logout.
GET {{api}}/v1/me/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Describe an owned uploaded photo (persist this key/body before sending)
POST {{api}}/v1/prompt-drafts
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotency_key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"upload_id":"{{upload_id}}"}

### Poll the task while foregrounded, or recover after reopening
GET {{api}}/v1/prompt-drafts/{{prompt_draft_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Cancel the same task; do not create a replacement generation
POST {{api}}/v1/prompt-drafts/{{prompt_draft_id}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
